title: "Orthonym"
abstract: >-
  Orthonym is a deterministic, rule-based engine that converts a molecular
  structure (SMILES) into its Preferred IUPAC Name, following the IUPAC 2013
  recommendations. In its default tier, every name is validated by an OPSIN
  round-trip before it is returned.
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
